{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_frostl_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_frostl_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "識字本",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_frostl_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bf7c2b6550708e2669098f891b004e1e2ae2bd189381e65702807c0f22e05a42",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這就結束了？今天我也沒有任務嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生說了，你現在只需要作為一名病人好好休息，養好身體，任務等以後再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，我要休息多久呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以現在的各項指標來看，單是貧血和營養不良這兩項就需要你好好休養一個月以上，才能保證身體恢復正常水準，更何況還有其他舊傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在徹底康復之前，我們不建議你從事任何劇烈運動，即使是康復訓練也會由我們安排，短期內你安心休養就可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "休息一個多月嗎？......可是醫生，我來你們這裡的時候，是作為雇傭兵被招進來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們說會有任務派給我，我是來賺飯錢的，沒有想著要在這裡看病休息，我也沒有錢給你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？這些事情按理來說入職合約上會寫清楚的，比如醫藥費會按比例從薪金中按月扣取之類的，你不知道這個嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“薪金”？是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃？就是你的工資、酬勞......呃，報酬？酬金？我這樣說你能理解嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，能，“報酬”的意思我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是不對啊，人事部的幹員沒給你解釋合約嗎？你就簽字了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不都是這樣嗎？你們給錢，我幹活，之前隊伍裡那種紙的作用也就是記一下這次小隊有多少人，給多少錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不是的。我建議你再去一下人事部，讓他們給你詳細地講一下合約的具體內容，不只是錢，還有其他很重要的條款需要你確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前我也遇到過不給錢的雇主，但你們這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉環顧著羅德島巨大但又精密的艦體內部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我第一次見這麼大還又能動的東西，你們應該不會欠我的錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是希望自己能快點分配到任務去做，要不然我會覺得很奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總感覺我們說的不是同一件事......你要是不想去的話，我只能作為一個醫生，建議你待會去仔細確認下你接下來養病的注意事項。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於剩下的，如果你覺得不適應，可以去和舍友聊天，去甲板上散步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中間樓層裡有不同的設施和活動空間，遊戲室、閱覽室，都可以去轉轉，好好享受新生活啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？還有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，那我先走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（完全沒有事情可做......一個月的休息時間，享受新生活？......什麼是新生活？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（“人事部”“遊戲室”“閱覽室”......都在哪裡？我也看不懂門上寫的字......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "加入麵粉，加入糖粉，攪拌攪拌~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米格魯，你這次可不能再把鹽花當成糖粉了哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒、沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌張的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但明明是你上次說要給芬烤生日餅乾，結果烤出了一個大爆炸......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？才沒有呢，那個是特殊驚喜呀~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不覺得那是驚喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，我明明看到你笑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚴肅的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......稍微安靜點，我們好像是打擾到那個沃爾珀小姐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快樂的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉，我不是故意的~那邊那位沃爾珀，過來和我們一起吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，我......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉看著不遠處擺放整齊的各色食材。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有點不明白，明明有能夠更快速把它們做成食物補充體力的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼要費很多時間去做這種酥酥的又一點都不好攜帶的東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和煦的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，這種香氣呢，有沒有讓你放鬆下來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和煦的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它是用你自己親手種的蘭花調的。從把種子埋下到開出第一朵花，如果沒有你每日的照顧，它也無法擁有這種香氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和煦的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "醫療部的幹員通常會推薦病人們多來這裡走走，不論是香薰還是這些植物，都會對你的健康有好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和煦的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位一直站在一邊的沃爾珀小姐，是這個香氣令你不悅嗎？或者，你想不想擁有一顆屬於自己的花種？我可以教你如何呵護它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有......那個是很好聞的味道，淡淡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝，但就算學會了種花，我覺得自己應該是用不上這項技能，花沒有什麼用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我從來沒有在同一個地方停留太久，就算是學會了種麥子，吃下它的也不會是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（看不懂說明書上寫的東西......光記得是一天吃三片，醫生說過是要在飯後？飯前？把它吃掉才行。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（好多藥片......分不清了，一起吃吧。之前也這樣吃過，睡了一晚上，第二天也就好了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等！你在幹什麼？這些藥怎麼能混著吃呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡不是有說明書嗎？你怎麼......哦......你是不是看不懂......？我知道了，你有本子嗎？我來畫給你吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我之前給不少幹員都畫過，你放心好了！雖然我還是個實習醫生，但保證我畫的東西又有特點你又能看懂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看，這個代表著飯前吃，空的碗就是飯後，數字你應該是認識的吧？吃幾片我就直接寫了哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒想到這種小事還要麻煩你，我之前自己都能一個人做到的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會記住這些東西的，不會再麻煩你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（門口有紅色花盆，裡面是葉片矮圓、半邊枯萎了的植物，是提供治療的地方，門牌上的字是有個尾巴的樣子，記住了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（往前右轉，看到紅色的門後進去直走，再左轉後的藍色門，門口有一個架子，上面種著葉子會垂下來的植物，是領藥的地方。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（有開黃色花植物的門是後勤部，可以領到生活用品。門牌上的字有點像兩個馱獸的是訓練室，可以在裡面做複健。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（用老辦法都能記住，就不用再麻煩別人幫我畫圖註明房間了。什麼事都需要別人幫忙，這樣的人在之前遲早會被隊友丟下。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（早點學會這些，早點達到他們的目標，也就能早點回到戰場做任務吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "後勤部的審批下來了？太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們終於能把這些舊門牌都換掉了！還有那些花，在走廊裡沒陽光真的養不活，我早說還不如分給幹員們自己去養！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高興的幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧走吧，我們這就去後勤部領東西，好好打掃一遍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（......我什麼時候才能算養好身體，去戰場上做任務？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我不是個傭兵嗎？為什麼來了這麼久，每天都在做點心、種花，然後被拉去摸摸小動物，這些對我來說究竟有什麼用？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我明明是來為他們上戰場的，但他們現在卻完全不需要我，而且剩下的事我每一件都做不好，不管是吃藥還是認路，都要別人幫我。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（......那我來這裡是幹什麼的？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "舍友都在出任務，宿舍裡只有霜葉一個人，她的桌面上堆放著不認識的幹員們送來的小禮物。\n幾本看不懂的書和小冊子，一些零食，幾盆植物，一副耳機。相比之前自己傭兵的包裹，這些東西豐富許多，也不必要許多。\n霜葉戴上耳機，她看到有人這樣做過，彷彿這樣能隔開外界一切的煩人事。\n舒緩的鼓點，綿長的哼唱，並不能聽明白的詞語組合在一起，霜葉跟著它哼唱起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼——哼哼♪哼......哼哼......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪哼......哼哼......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......安靜下來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼——哼哼♪哼......哼哼......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我是♪......星星......黑色......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（剩下的都聽不懂了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "霜葉，今天的訓練量我認為已經夠了，再練下去可能會超出你身體的負荷能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "霜葉幹員好厲害......明明還在恢復中，但是我有時候還會招架不住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡，霜葉今天不能再和你一起練啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，我會自己再努力的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們這種流浪傭兵肯定用的方法和你們不太一樣，你也很厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給我安排的和你對練的時間越來越短，醫生也看出來你越來越強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我得一直在這裡看著才行。霜葉，來這裡我再給你測一下運動後的各項數據。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "順便，你在聽音樂嗎？這幾天看你一直都戴著耳機，感覺你已經找到一點樂趣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......還不錯？只是聽了它之後就覺得心情沒那麼煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用擔心，你的身體恢復速度比我們預料的快上很多，或許下次體檢會合格都說不定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼——哼哼♪哼......哼哼......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是♪......昨天......哭泣......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "追著♪......丟掉的......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看你高興的。數據測完了，我先走啦！醫療部還有很多事。你再休息一下就可以自由活動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個，醫生，我想問問，你聽過這首歌嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼歌？......沒聽過，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是有點想知道它在唱什麼。感覺，是個很安靜的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得樓下的活動室裡有幹員們的讀書分享會，你可以去參加一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......讀書分享會還是算了，讀書對我來說有些沒有必要。我只是想知道它在唱什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......那我推薦你去閱覽室，那邊有字典可以借閱。你知道怎麼走嗎，需不需要我送你去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果門牌和植物沒有被更換的話，我是知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事！我能自己過去，謝謝你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*模糊不清的發音*？還是......*模糊不清的發音*？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "長得像野草一樣的詞，後面跟著一個鱗尾一樣的勾......是“星空”的意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*模糊不清的發音*......“遺失的”......“目睹”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“眼淚”......“醉酒”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“眼淚醉酒，看遺失的星空，點亮，瘋狂地度過年少”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“可悲地照亮，但不能做到，丟掉吧，丟掉吧，跳舞並且哭泣”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對應著每個詞都寫下來了，但這幾句話都是什麼......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這根本就不是人能明白的意思啊？是我翻譯錯了嗎？但字典上一個一個對應著找出來的，不應該有問題才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼回事啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眼淚醉酒——目睹遺失的星空♪點亮瘋狂......度過年少......♪丟掉吧，丟掉吧，跳舞並且哭泣♪？呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好難聽，好奇怪！感覺那個人根本就不是這麼唱的，反而更煩了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怎麼什麼都做不好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉有些懊惱地甩下耳機，一些零碎的聲音從耳機裡傳出，斷斷續續地飄進她的耳朵。\n哼——哼哼♪哼......哼哼......♪\n♪哼......哼哼......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就不信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宿舍的桌面上還堆放著幹員們送的禮物，霜葉從抽屜裡翻出已經被自己收起來的識字本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“我、吃、餅乾，主謂賓。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“開心的我、慢慢地吃、美味的餅乾、飽了，定狀補。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“......用以修飾詞語，使句意更加豐富、完整。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那“眼淚醉酒”其實是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“沉醉於眼淚”？加上前面的這個詞，“不如”，“不如讓我們沉醉於眼淚”？很奇怪的句子，但好像，有點美......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，之前看錯了，這個詞是“閱讀”，怎麼長得這麼像啊？“閱讀、閱覽、翻閱”這幾個詞的意思相近，長得像一隻羽獸飛了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一隻羽獸飛了起來？這個詞的樣子好像就是剛才那間屋子門牌上的字......“閱覽室”，能夠閱讀書的地方。哦......原來是這個意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有那天看到的像兩個馱獸一樣的詞，是“禁止”，不允許的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個詞是“電影”，上次他們邀請我看的就是這個。還有“目錄”，看到過很多次，食堂和醫務室都有這個詞......扯遠了，繼續看歌詞吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔，那這句歌詞的意思有可能是“我們在瘋狂地度過年少，試圖點亮夜空”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“不如讓我們沉醉於眼淚，然後以為自己是一顆遺失的星星”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“卻希望能照亮另一片天空”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......還是不能特別明白什麼意思，為什麼最後是說“不要看我，我只是一個失意的人，試圖挽回你”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這和星星夜空、喝醉還有年少時光有什麼關係？最後那幾句更像是之前隊裡湯姆和凱蒂分手了，他找她時說的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看不懂......什麼意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉仰躺在宿舍的地板上，目光漫無目的地劃過牆上舍友貼上的告示和海報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“閱覽室”“禁止”“帶入食物”，“下周”“觀看電影”“目錄”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是這個意思嗎？剛剛在字典裡查錯的詞裡有這些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，我能看懂了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼——哼哼♪哼......哼哼......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們在瘋狂地度過年少，試圖點亮夜空♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不如讓我們沉醉於眼淚，然後以為自己是一顆遺失的星星♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卻希望能照亮另一片天空♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很不一樣的形容，像那天那個電影裡面的人說的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "終於對照著查完了，這些歌詞的意思其實沒有那麼難，好像就是關於愛情的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來是一個年輕人想要挽回他已經分開的愛人，然後覺得自己是一顆失落的星星......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過照亮夜空的意思完全不懂......為什麼他想要照亮夜空？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉收起手中的識字本，幾張紙被她翻得皺皺巴巴。\n她活動活動脖子，走出自己待了好久的宿舍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "外面的走廊還是走廊，房間還是房間，但是——\n“羅德島幹員須知”\n“食堂今日菜單，萊塔尼亞大廚坐鎮！”\n“家裡寄來的柳丁，大家吃吃！”\n“別忘了今天調香師庭院有活動！”\n“零食架已補貨！”\n她突然發現自己能看懂這些原本並無意義的符號，門牌、菜單、小告示，它們有了自己的意義。\n好像是這裡突然以另一種方式接納了她一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，霜葉小姐！你要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我......霜葉小姐，請稍等一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“遊戲室”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "霜葉小姐，剛才我就說，你的麵粉放太多啦，而且蛋白霜都已經洩氣了，這樣做出來的餅乾會很硬哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看，我說的沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但作為新手來說很好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要不要自己吃一口試試看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔、唔！真的好硬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗，哈哈哈~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“遊戲室”這個詞的意思是......一塊很硬的餅乾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉翻開自己的識字本，在“遊戲室”的詞語旁畫了一個尚能看出是餅乾的圓形，和三個擠在一起的小人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“庭院”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你叫霜葉，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然不知道這個代號的本意，但我猜也許是“降霜後的紅葉”，嗯，是個很美的意象呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你來聞聞這個香氣試試看，有沒有讓你感覺身處在一片落雪的楓葉林中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......聞起來是清涼的......乾枯樹葉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對，就是這個味道啦，它是根據你的名字調的。體會不到樂趣也沒有關係，要是哪天你突然對調香和種植有了興致，歡迎再來我這裡呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“庭院”這個詞的意思是......落雪後的楓葉林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉翻著識字本，找到“庭院”這個詞語，在一旁畫上了一片楓葉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“食堂”是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你看不懂藥品說明，那菜單呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來，我一個一個給你說，食堂今天有分區，這邊是維多利亞師傅做的，這邊是哥倫比亞師傅做的，味道都很不錯哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你——應該吃這個分區裡的，營養美味的恢復餐啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我來給你念菜單，你決定吃哪個好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“食堂”是每天都能被堆滿的餐盤，和芙蓉小姐給我畫的每日服藥說明書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉畫上一盤食物和一張手稿。\n一頁又一頁，原本只有亂糟糟筆記的識字本上，霜葉補上了各種各樣的小小圖案，好像這些詞有了新的解釋一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "霜葉小姐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "霜葉小姐——！你別跑啦——教官讓我告訴你，我們明天的訓練都可以升級啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼——呼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡，你可以再借我一支筆嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？可以，給你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在畫什麼呀，一個......桌子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，上面是“耳機”“識字本”，還有“盆栽”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“荒野”旁畫的是一口鍋和一個小棚，“戰場”旁畫的是一群人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，這些是我來這裡之前的生活。在荒地上搭一個棚，會有任務來找上你，幸運的人活下來，更多的人再也沒有回來過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很辛苦吧......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......我不知道，我從小都是那樣子過來的。其實，來了這裡我反而有些不適應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，“走廊”這個詞旁邊畫的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個正在流淚的菲林小頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要去訓練了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然後......我想去找一下克洛絲還有調香師她們，我有句謝謝要和她們說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也謝謝你，潔西卡，等上了戰場，我們也會是很好的隊友吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......呼......長跑任務完成了......感覺還可以，沒有很累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的身體應該是完全恢復了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼——哼哼♪哼......哼哼......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們在瘋狂地度過年少，試圖點亮夜空♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不如讓我們沉醉於眼淚，然後以為自己是一顆遺失的星星♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卻希望能照亮另一片天空♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卻希望能照亮另一片天空♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......這個歌詞好像也可以這樣解釋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就是那顆失落的星星......也希望照亮這方夜空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "霜葉仰頭看向天空，身後的巨艦轟鳴著發出準備啟程的啟動聲，準備出發向下一個目的地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該去向凱爾希醫生申請了，我覺得我已經完全可以返回戰場了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是醫生們想看到的吧？我的身體完全恢復了，還新長了點肌肉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再加上工程部還會幫我維修武器，呼......說不定我能在戰場上發揮得更好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生一定會同意的，我馬上就可以返回戰場了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "終於......這才是我最應該做的事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
